@startuml Key Lifecycle State Machine
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #e1f5ff
  BorderColor #0277bd
  FontColor #000000
}

[*] --> Generated: App Install\nNew Device

Generated --> Active: Key stored\nin Keychain/KeyStore
note right of Generated
  Fresh entropy generated
  Private key stored securely
  Ready for first use
end note

Active --> Active: Signing Credentials\nProof of Possession\nDID:key generation
note right of Active
  Active operational state
  Primary use of key
  Can issue signatures
  Can create DIDs
end note

Active --> Retired: Manual rotation\nOR\nKey rollover event
note right of Active
  Rotation initiated by:\n- User action\n- Periodic schedule\n- Policy requirement
end note

Retired --> Retired: Verification Only\nNo new signatures
note right of Retired
  Can verify old credentials
  Can resolve DIDs
  Cannot sign new data
  Archive period: 30 days
end note

Retired --> Deleted: 30-day grace period\nexpires
note right of Retired
  Allows time for:\n- Certificate verification\n- Credential validation\n- Final operations
end note

Deleted --> [*]: Securely erased\nfrom Keychain/KeyStore
note right of Deleted
  Permanent deletion
  No recovery possible
  Cryptographic erasure
end note

Active --> Deleted: Device Wipe\nManual Deletion
note right of Active
  Force delete (emergency)
  Immediate removal
  All keys lost
end note

@enduml
